    new "Aceptado. Sabes dónde encontrarme."

    # post-scene
    old "That was transactional. Nothing more. Don't read into it."
    new "Eso fue transaccional. Nada más. No le busques significado."
    old "We're done. Don't tell anyone about this. I have a reputation."
    new "Terminamos. No le digas a nadie. Tengo una reputación."
    old "Same time next week? ...I'm joking. Mostly."
    new "¿Misma hora la próxima semana? ...Es broma. Más o menos."
    old "This is becoming a pattern. I'm not sure how I feel about that."
    new "Esto se está volviendo un patrón. No estoy segura de cómo me siento al respecto."
    old "Efficient as always. See you next time."
    new "Eficiente como siempre. Hasta la próxima."
    old "Another successful transaction. The door is always open."
    new "Otra transacción exitosa. La puerta siempre está abierta."

    # inline post-scene
    old "That happened. Moving on. Don't bring it up."
    new "Eso pasó. Sigamos adelante. No lo menciones."
    old "Quick and clean. Exactly how I like business."
    new "Rápido y limpio. Exactamente como me gustan los negocios."

    # shock
    old "You... actually paid that? I named that price to scare you off."
    new "¿De verdad... pagaste eso? Dije ese precio para asustarte."
    old "Wait. No. I was testing you. Give that back."
    new "Espera. No. Te estaba probando. Devuelve eso."
    old "...A deal is a deal. I said a number. You paid it. I keep my word."
    new "...Un trato es un trato. Dije un número. Pagaste. Cumplo mi palabra."
    old "Smart. Now leave before I raise my rates."
    new "Inteligente. Ahora vete antes de que suba mis tarifas."

    # girl-initiated
    old "I've been thinking. $%(price)d and I'll %(act)s. Strictly business."
    new "He estado pensando. $%(price)d y haré %(act)s. Estrictamente negocios."
    old "Your loss. The offer won't last forever."
    new "Tu pérdida. La oferta no durará para siempre."

    # negotiate
    old "I didn't set the price to be generous. Pay it or don't."
    new "No puse el precio para ser generosa. Paga o no pagues."
